<title>HONG KONG: Siu-Fung's abandons U.S. spin-off plan.</title>
<headline>Siu-Fung's abandons U.S. spin-off plan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Siu-Fung Ceramics Holdings Ltd has abandoned its plan to seek a separate listing for its subsidiary NHD International Ltd in New York, the company said in a statement published on Monday.</p>
</text>
